flowchart TD
    A[Application calls IPaddleOcrClient] --> B[Validate method arguments]
    B --> C[Sanitize multipart filename]
    C --> D[Create ByteArrayContent]
    D --> E[Set validated image content type]
    E --> F[Create multipart form field named file]
    F --> G[HttpClient sends POST to configured OCR URL]

    G --> H{Request completed?}

    H -- Connection failure --> I[Translate to Unavailable]
    H -- Client timeout --> J[Translate to Timeout]
    H -- Caller cancelled --> K[Preserve OperationCanceledException]
    H -- Response received --> L{Success status?}

    L -- No --> M[Translate to ServiceError]
    L -- Yes --> N[Deserialize JSON response]

    N --> O{Valid JSON?}
    O -- No --> P[Translate to InvalidResponse]
    O -- Yes --> Q[Validate response structure]

    Q --> R{Contract valid?}
    R -- No --> P
    R -- Yes --> S[Return PaddleOcrResponse]